それ以外(文書、様式、項目、見本のデータ、画像)は、クリエイティブ・コモンズ 表示
4.0 国際 ライセンス(CC BY 4.0)で提供します。ライセンスの内容は
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.ja をご覧ください。

The forms in rirekisho/ are made from the Ministry of Health, Labour and
Welfare's resume example (厚生労働省「履歴書様式例」), which the Ministry
publishes at https://kouseisaiyou.mhlw.go.jp/methods.html under the Public
Data License 1.0. The source is in rirekisho/README.md.

The item lists in kaigyo/ are made from the National Tax Agency's forms and
their guides (国税庁「個人事業の開業・廃業等届出書」「所得税の青色申告承認
申請書」). The sources are in kaigyo/README.md. The ministries publish these
under the Public Data License 1.0 (公共データ利用規約 第1.0版), which is
compatible with CC BY 4.0. This repository is not made by the government.

The item list in nougyou/ is made from the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry
and Fisheries' 青年等就農計画認定申請書 and its guides, published under the
same Public Data License 1.0. The source is in nougyou/README.md.
